Description: Preamp control for Roland REAC stageboxes
 A GTK4 and libadwaita application that sets phantom power, the pad and the
 sensitivity on every input of every REAC stagebox on the wire.
 .
 It is a PipeWire client and nothing else. It binds the nodes reac-pw
 publishes, shows each box's inputs, and writes the change back through the
 daemon. A control the box cannot take is shown with the reason instead of a
 dead switch.

